From: Wine upstream contributors (see commit list)
Subject: [PATCH] Backport targeted Wine 11.20 fixes.

Squashed backport of 37 WineHQ commits, applied in upstream order on top of
cx26.3-wine11.0-runeon.23 patches 0001-0134. 35 were first released in wine-11.20; 5e5ca9fefc and
076438fa7c (wine-11.12) are prerequisites of 794feb9289 and fix the same wide-string replace.
Test-only hunks are omitted.
Adaptations, marked [adapted] below: 146fbbe78b is applied to dlls/dmband/bandtrack.c, where the
base still keeps the band track (upstream moved it to dmusic in 220b4e7ff6); 48e2d50404 is the same
one-line change below the CrossOver Quicken hack in macdrv_GetWindowStyleMasks().

  5e5ca9fefc Bartosz Kosiorek: msvcp: Use sizeof(wchar_t) instead of sizeof(char) for basic_string_wchar_replace_ch.
  076438fa7c Bartosz Kosiorek: msvcp: Use sizeof(wchar_t) instead of sizeof(char) for basic_string_wchar_replace_cstr_len.
  6f14a8ea45 Evan Morse: d3d8: Do not decrease texture refcount when it is already 0.
  16c13088f9 Matteo Bruni: d3dx11: Always fix up texture dimensions.
  547e01858d Matteo Bruni: d3dx10: Always fix up texture dimensions.
  73cc740a01 Conor McCarthy: winegstreamer: Check for null wg_transform in video encoder ProcessMessage().
  d7c49769d9 Conor McCarthy: winegstreamer: Return error codes from wg_transform_create_quartz().
  33fba6fc26 Conor McCarthy: winegstreamer: Do not ignore failure in wma decoder SetOutputType().
  52f8e6b5a5 Conor McCarthy: winegstreamer: Hold only one reference to the async result in media_sink_begin_finalize().
  774cb470c5 Conor McCarthy: winegstreamer: Avoid using uninitialised count in media_source_start().
  90e98d3d94 Conor McCarthy: winegstreamer: Check for allocation failure in media_object_GetOutputType().
  146fbbe78b Michael Stefaniuc: dmusic: Avoid adding an unitialized band ptr in a Band Track. [adapted]
  9eb4614ad7 Conor McCarthy: dinput: Only wait for the input thread to complete cleanup.
  f564234cb2 Bernhard Übelacker: wininet: Improve invalid parameter handling in APPINFO_QueryOption.
  436ec312c3 Bernhard Übelacker: wininet: Improve invalid parameter handling in HTTPREQ_QueryOption.
  86b80d02b6 Piotr Caban: vcruntime140_1: Don't depent on DLL_THREAD_ATTACH for CxxFrameHandler4 trylevel initialization.
  bf9b5e567c Alistair Leslie-Hughes: crypt32: Don't return from within a __TRY block.
  07c33a0e92 Alistair Leslie-Hughes: wintypes: Correctly release interface in map_entry_clear.
  0e7224e852 Anton Baskanov: winmm: Use wine_midi_stream_free() to free MIDI stream.
  baa7c5d335 Alistair Leslie-Hughes: hnetcfg: Only assign output on success in NetFwPolicy2_create.
  0740f54989 Piotr Caban: msvcp60: Fix mbsrtowcs() implementation.
  bbf2ae736c Piotr Caban: msvcp90: Use correct locale in codecvt_short__Getcat.
  199cc0386e Piotr Caban: msvcp90: Fix FMTFLAG_showpoint handling in num_put_wchar__Ffmt.
  19b112a917 Piotr Caban: msvcp90: Fix typos in time_put<> RTTI data.
  f011c203a0 Piotr Caban: msvcp90: Fix error path handling in locale_ctor_locale_cstr.
  f0fef9fef7 Piotr Caban: msvcp90: Fix incorrect len usage in _Strxfrm.
  00469cf5cf Piotr Caban: msvcp90: Fix off-by-one error in codecvt_char16_do_in.
  43b83b580f Michael Stefaniuc: dmusic: MultiByteToWideChar() dest size is in WCHARs and not bytes.
  3d27b08dde Piotr Caban: msvcp90: Don't crash on NULL rdbuf in basic_ostream::operator<< functions.
  c54fd1eac5 Piotr Caban: msvcp90: Don't crash on NULL rdbuf in basic_istream::operator>> functions.
  c9173a6c5d Piotr Caban: msvcp60: Don't crash on NULL rdbuf in basic_ostream::operator<< functions.
  fb997bf426 Piotr Caban: msvcp60: Don't crash on NULL rdbuf in basic_istream::operator>> functions.
  794feb9289 Piotr Caban: msvcp60: Fix crash when writing NULL-terminator in basic_string::replace().
  ad23bc1551 Piotr Caban: msvcp60: Use correct locale in basic_ios::narrow and basic_ios::widen.
  0875da63b7 Symon Wang: kernelbase: Support desktop app policy in process/thread attributes list.
  81e52628b2 Paul Gofman: ntdll: Make sure entry is removed from queue if unlocked entry.addr precheck in RtlWaitOnAddress() suggests so.
  48e2d50404 Jactry Zeng: winemac.drv: Fix a typo to avoid usage of an uninitialized variable. [adapted]

